  /// <summary>
  /// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
  /// CertificateBinding — the canonical, durable, server-controlled mTLS binding
  /// (UDB-AUTH-007). Maps a TLS peer-certificate selector to a service-account
  /// grant, so an mTLS-only request authenticates through server-side state: the
  /// verified certificate resolves a binding, the binding resolves the account's
  /// CURRENT ServiceAccountGrant, and the principal (tenant/project/scopes) is
